  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "De Broglie wavelength $(\\lambda)=\\frac{h}{m v}$\n$$\n\\frac{6.63 \\times 10^{-34}}{6.63 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 100}=10^{-33} \\mathrm{~m}\n$$",
    "image": null
